<title>USA: Sprint Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Sprint Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.57     loss	 $0.98</p>
<p> Net	 profit     245,300     loss     343,200</p>
<p> Revs		   3,622,000		3,338,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 433,800		  351,400</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 income from continuing operations before ventures and non-recurring charges was $0.80 a share vs $0.83.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $2.78   profit	 $1.12</p>
<p> Net	profit    1,183,800   profit     395,300</p>
<p> Revs		  14,044,700	     12,765,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 426,000		  350,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 income from continuing operations before ventures and non-recurring charges was $3.29 a share vs $2.95.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
